@startuml end-to-end-flow
title From a quiet aircraft to a card on your screen

skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #888888
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #AAAAAA

start

:An aircraft goes quiet, and\nsomething unexpected happens nearby;
:The system notices both facts\nand decides they're one incident;
:It writes one combined alert,\nand a note that the old alert\nis now replaced;
:That gets saved to the database\nas a single, all-or-nothing step;
:Every connected dashboard\nis told about both changes;
:The alert list on screen redraws:\none combined card, the old\nalert tucked underneath it;

stop
@enduml
